## Comparator status

The final package includes a fixed-order reference ROBDD implementation. It is **not CUDD**. An attempted `dd` installation log is retained at `reproducibility/logs/install_dd.log`. Optimized CUDD, DSD, ACD, industrial knowledge-compilation, and tensor comparators were not executed in this baseline.

## Dataset status

The measured set contains 38 functions: 26 outputs from one pinned external EPFL control design plus 12 intentional synthetic controls. The 26 outputs are related outputs of a single design and must not be interpreted as 26 independent external circuits. Timing cases stop at n=12.

## Source snapshots

`reproducibility/versions/v1`, `v2`, and `v3` preserve the implementation snapshots corresponding to manuscript freezes. The top-level current code includes subsequent fixes and must not be represented as byte-identical to an earlier timing arm.
